WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:15.140
The family was in the kitchen.

2
00:00:15.141 --> 00:00:18.788
Mom was cooking dinner.

3
00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:22.460
"How was school today?" Dad asked.

4
00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:27.040
"We had a fire drill," said Emmy.

5
00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:31.062
"Everybody had to walk outside," said Harry.

6
00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:34.033
"Hmm," said Dad.

7
00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.339
"We should have a family fire drill."

8
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.125
"Yes!" said Mom.

9
00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:46.318
"Let's have a fire drill before dinner."

10
00:00:46.319 --> 00:00:50.194
"What should we do?" Emmy asked.

11
00:00:50.195 --> 00:00:55.311
Dad pointed to the smoke alarm.

12
00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:59.315
"I'll make the smoke alarm go off," he said.

13
00:00:59.316 --> 00:01:03.678
"Then we'll walk outside to a safe place."

14
00:01:03.679 --> 00:01:08.862
"Let's go to the tree house!" Oliver said.

15
00:01:08.863 --> 00:01:12.051
"Good idea!" Dad said.

16
00:01:12.052 --> 00:01:16.369
"Get ready, everybody!"

17
00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:21.247
"I'll tell Aunt Judy to get ready," Emmy said.

18
00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:26.645
Emmy ran to Aunt Judy's room.

19
00:01:26.646 --> 00:01:31.382
Oliver and Harry ran to Harry's room.

20
00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:34.451
Everybody waited.

21
00:01:34.452 --> 00:01:38.418
Whoop! Whoop! went the smoke alarm.

22
00:01:38.419 --> 00:01:43.423
Everybody walked quickly to the tree house.

23
00:01:43.424 --> 00:01:47.453
Dad counted the family.

24
00:01:47.454 --> 00:01:50.360
"Six people!"

25
00:01:50.361 --> 00:01:53.912
"Our family is safe," Mom said.

26
00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:58.710
"Good job, everyone!"

27
00:01:58.711 --> 00:02:01.760
The family walked back to the house.

28
00:02:01.761 --> 00:02:07.862
Dad opened the back door.

29
00:02:07.863 --> 00:02:11.620
Harry sniffed.

30
00:02:11.621 --> 00:02:16.749
Emmy sniffed.

31
00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:20.286
"Something smells bad," said Harry.

32
00:02:20.287 --> 00:02:22.512
"Yes!" said Emmy.

33
00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:25.795
"I smell smoke!"

34
00:02:25.796 --> 00:02:28.416
"Oh no!" Mom cried.

35
00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:35.837
She ran to the stove.

36
00:02:35.838 --> 00:02:44.386
"I burned our dinner!"
